BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Study the Stars from Homolovi
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTSTAMP:20260929T170741Z
UID:ce853d675242cb11b0ee525e@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Star parties take place monthly through November at Homolovi S
 tate Park. The events feature a guest speaker at 6:00 p.m. in the visitor 
 center followed by dark sky viewing through the Winslow Homolovi Observato
 ry’s Moore Telescope. Night sky targets will change throughout the year 
 but may include deep space nebulae\, star clusters\, and more. Homolovi is
  the only one of Arizona’s state parks that contains its own observatory
 . Each event is free with park admission. Thank you to the Little Colorado
  River Valley Astronomy Club for supporting these astronomy events. Learn 
 more about them at[www.lcrvac.org](http://www.lcrvac.org/) or[nightsky.jpl
 .nasa.gov/clubs/lcrvac](http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/clubs/lcrvac/). Infor
 mation about guest speakers will be updated as it becomes available. Novem
 ber 14\, 2026 - 6 p.m.\n\nEvent website: https://azstateparks.com/homolovi
 /events/star-party-homolovi\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitari
 zona.com/events/study-the-stars-from-homolovi-51af6
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T170741Z
LOCATION:Homolovi State Park\, AZ-87\, Winslow\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/study-the-stars-from-homolovi-51af
 6
