 g vistas of Douglas\, Arizona\, and Cochise County\, uncovering hidden gem
 s and unforgettable experiences along the way. The gravel on the Geronimo 
 Trail is nothing short of exceptional\, offering fantastic conditions for 
 riders of all levels and passing through historic landmarks such as the Jo
 hn Slaughter Ranch and the San Bernardino National Wildlife Refuge. It isn
 ’t just a race. It’s an experience.\n\nEvent website: https://www.bord
 erlandsgravel.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/
