BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Route 66 UltraRun
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTSTAMP:20260929T170741Z
UID:0a22ee6607dacf7754bc98e2@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The race recognizes and celebrates the history of the Mother R
 oad. From the Bunion Derbies\; “Oakie’s” during the Dust Bowl\; the 
 boom years of family road trips after WWII\; decline after the interstate 
 system bypassed mom- and-pop motels\, restaurants\, and shops\; to grassro
 ots resurgence leading to official recognition that Route 66 had “become
  a symbol of the American people’s heritage of travel and their legacy o
 f seeking a better life.” Options are available for a fast solo runner\,
  a team player or even a walker. Individual runners or relay teams Route 6
 6 Centennial Certified Event 140 Miles of History\n\nEvent website: https:
 //route66ultrarun.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.
 com/events/route-66-ultrarun
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T170741Z
LOCATION:22265 Historic Route 66\, Seligman\, AZ 86337
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/route-66-ultrarun
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Study the Stars from Homolovi
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTSTAMP:20260929T170741Z
UID:930c79d7e28bd8cfa0e6944c@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The star party features a guest speaker at 6:00 p.m. in the vi
 sitor center\, followed by dark sky viewing through the Winslow Homolovi O
 bservatory’s Moore Telescope. Night sky targets will change throughout t
 he year but may include deep space nebulae\, star clusters\, and more. Hom
 olovi is the only one of Arizona’s state parks that contains its own obs
 ervatory. Each event is free with park admission. Thank you to the Little 
 Colorado River Valley Astronomy Club for supporting these astronomy events
 . Learn more about them at[www.lcrvac.org](http://www.lcrvac.org/) or[nigh
 tsky.jpl.nasa.gov/clubs/lcrvac](http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/clubs/lcrvac/
 ). Information about guest speakers will be updated as it becomes availabl
 e.\n\nEvent website: https://azstateparks.com/homolovi/events/star-party-h
